sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Web / MCP / CLI caller
    participant Adapter as Thin adapter
    participant Service as Application service
    participant Model as Django model contract
    participant DB as HQ database
    participant Audit as Audit log

    Caller->>Adapter: Typed request
    Adapter->>Service: Command + authenticated actor
    Service->>Model: Validate fields and relationships
    Model-->>Service: Canonical validated values
    Service->>DB: Begin atomic transaction
    Service->>DB: Lock / compare version / write
    Service->>Audit: Record interface, actor, operation
    alt every step succeeds
        Service->>DB: Commit
        Service-->>Adapter: Canonical result object
        Adapter-->>Caller: Render for its transport
    else validation, conflict, or write fails
        Service->>DB: Roll back
        Service-->>Adapter: Structured failure
        Adapter-->>Caller: No partial state
    end
